  "notes": "{熱|あつ}い refers to hot objects/liquids and passionate feelings.\n\nDISTINCTION FROM SIMILAR WORDS:\n- {熱|あつ}い: hot to the touch (objects, liquids); passionate\n- {暑|あつ}い: hot weather, uncomfortable heat\n- {厚|あつ}い: thick (objects)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {熱|あつ}いお{湯|ゆ}: hot water\n- {熱|あつ}いコーヒー: hot coffee\n- {熱|あつ}い{視線|しせん}: passionate gaze\n- {熱|あつ}い{戦|たたか}い: heated battle\n- {胸|むね}が{熱|あつ}くなる: to feel moved/emotional\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverbial: {熱|あつ}く\n- Noun form: {熱|あつ}さ (heat intensity)\n\nIDIOMATIC:\n- {熱|あつ}い{思|おも}い: passionate feelings\n- {鉄|てつ}は{熱|あつ}いうちに{打|う}て: Strike while the iron is hot",
